|                                                             |
|     +--+---+--+                                             |
|o4 = |0 |0  |g |                                             |
|     |  |   | 1|                                             |
|     +--+---+--+                                             |
|     |0 |-g |0 |                                             |
|     |  |  1|  |                                             |
|     +--+---+--+                                             |
|     |g |0  |0 |                                             |
|     | 1|   |  |                                             |
|     +--+---+--+                                             |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+

