makeRes -- creates a resolution starting from three matrices
************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        makeRes(d1,d2,d3)
  * Inputs:
      * d1, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, of the differential in
        degree 1
      * d2, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, of the differential in
        degree 2
      * d3, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, of the differential in
        degree 3
  * Outputs:
      * a *note complex: (Complexes)Complex,, the resolution with differentials
        d1, d2, d3.

Description
===========

Creates a resolution of length 3 that has the given three matrices as
differentials.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : Q = QQ[x,y,z];                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : d1=matrix{{-x^2,z^2-x*y,-y^2,-x*z,-y*z}}                                |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = | -x2 -xy+z2 -y2 -xz -yz |                                              |
|                                                                             |
|             1      5                                                        |
|o2 : Matrix Q  <-- Q                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : d2=matrix{{0,0,z,0,-y},{0,0,0,-y,x},{-z,0,0,x,0},{0,y,-x,0,z},{y,-x,0,-z|
|                                                                             |
|o3 = | 0  0  z  0  -y |                                                      |
|     | 0  0  0  -y x  |                                                      |
|     | -z 0  0  x  0  |                                                      |
|     | 0  y  -x 0  z  |                                                      |
|     | y  -x 0  -z 0  |                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|             5      5                                                        |
|o3 : Matrix Q  <-- Q                                                         |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|,0}}                                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : d3=transpose d1                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = {-2} | -x2    |                                                         |
|     {-2} | -xy+z2 |                                                         |
|     {-2} | -y2    |                                                         |
|     {-2} | -xz    |                                                         |
|     {-2} | -yz    |                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|             5      1                                                        |
|o4 : Matrix Q  <-- Q                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : makeRes(d1,d2,d3)                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|      1      5      5      1                                                 |
|o5 = Q  <-- Q  <-- Q  <-- Q                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|     0      1      2      3                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : Complex                                                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

